@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Отримати JWT для admin (пароль admin123)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=

> {%
    client.test("JWT issued", () => client.assert(response.status === 200));
    if (response.status === 200) client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}
